repository-code: "https://github.com/mslave231/Eclipse-stride-pattern-with-off-stride-eclipses-sharing-intervals-and-forming-lt-cycles"
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX        <- add the repository's Zenodo DOI once it exists
abstract: >-
  A catalog of every solar and lunar eclipse from -13198 to +17189 (145,356 eclipses) computed from the
  JPL DE441 ephemeris, with the data and code behind a 23.5/34.5-synodic-month stride pattern, the 5,124
  off-stride eclipses, their 112 alternating cycles and the 16,377 intervals they share.
keywords:
  - solar eclipses
  - lunar eclipses
  - eclipse catalog
  - Saros
  - Inex
  - DE441
  - synodic month
